 │░│                                                                                        │░│
 │░│  HUMANOID, by Malte Maas                                                               │░│
 │░│  Designer, Technical Artist, Animation & Capture Director                              │░│
 │░│  Based in Düsseldorf, Germany, I have created a diverse range of projects              │░│
 │░│  for industrial & automotive visualization, TV commercials, virtual worlds,            │░│
 │░│  worldwide 360° video productions, and various motioncapture & animation projects.     │░│
 │░│                                                                                        │░│
 │░│  For over 30 years, my journey through digital production has been fueled              │░│
 │░│  by a deep fascination with technology and its endless potential to create.            │░│
 │░│  To me, computers are the ultimate tool to craft visual spaces,                        │░│
 │░│  3D worlds, and imagery designed to evoke genuine, positive emotion in the viewer.     │░│
 │░│                                                                                        │░│
 │░│  The references below represent decades of full-throttle execution.                    │░│
 │░│  Today, the digital world is shifting again, and so am I.                              │░│
 │░│  Humanoid is currently operating as a private sandbox.                                 │░│
 │░│  While the commercial studio doors are closed, the passion for capturing reality       │░│
 │░│  and shaping digital assets remains.                                                   │░│
 │░│  I am currently focusing on independent projects and exploring new creative horizons.  │░│
